#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/plot-quantum-states/extracted-outputs/752f7232-dfe5-457b-82f1-8a4ab5837aef-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/plot-quantum-states/extracted-outputs/752f7232-dfe5-457b-82f1-8a4ab5837aef-0.svg)\n"

